OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Feeling very warm and locally
OL,10,Fhot.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHot
OL,13,For very hot on Thursday with plenty of
OL,14,Fstrong sunshine. Turning a little
OL,15,Ffresher and cloudier from Friday with
OL,16,Fperhaps the chance of an odd shower on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
